---
import { Image } from 'astro:assets';
import profile from '../assets/profile.jpg';
import { softSkills } from '../data/skills';
---

<section id="about" class="mx-auto max-w-5xl px-6 py-20 sm:py-28">
  <div class="grid items-start gap-10 md:grid-cols-[260px_1fr] md:gap-14">
    <div class="reveal">
      <Image
        src={profile}
        alt="Portrait of Hugo De Bosschere"
        widths={[260, 520]}
        sizes="(min-width: 768px) 260px, 70vw"
        class="w-full max-w-[260px] rounded-2xl border border-border object-cover shadow-sm"
      />
    </div>

    <div class="reveal">
      <p class="text-sm font-medium tracking-widest text-accent uppercase">About</p>
      <h2 class="mt-3 font-display text-3xl leading-tight tracking-tight sm:text-4xl">
        I like building things, end to end.
      </h2>

      <div class="mt-5 space-y-4 leading-relaxed text-ink/90">
        <p>
          I'm a software engineer who likes being close to both the product and the code. I get the
          most out of taking a rough idea and turning it into something real: a clear interface, a
          system you can rely on, a feature that actually feels finished.
        </p>
        <p>
          During my internship at <strong class="font-medium text-ink">In The Pocket</strong> I worked
          as a full-stack developer. My main project was the internal ITP Profile Tool, which I built
          end to end with React and TypeScript on the front end and C# and .NET on the back end.
          Alongside it I built a spatial-computing app for the Apple Vision Pro with Unity and
          PolySpatial. I move easily between the interface and the systems behind it, and I care about
          getting things right early: fixing threading bugs in production taught me to catch problems
          before they reach users, not after. I'm a recent graduate with high distinction, proactive
          and quick to learn, and I do my best work in a team that values clean code and quality.
        </p>
      </div>

      <ul class="mt-7 flex flex-wrap gap-2">
        {
          softSkills.map((s) => (
            <li class="rounded-full border border-border bg-surface px-3 py-1.5 text-sm text-muted">
              {s}
            </li>
          ))
        }
      </ul>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>
